; woods_deep.room - the deep woods: giant trunks and branch ledges over a root mound (design 04 section 3.4).
; Gates: the canopy opening (cols 48-55) is 7 rows above the row-4 branch (double jump); the hole to the root
; caves sits in a pocket past a water pit under a low stone ceiling (Enraizar bridge, earth banks cols 32/40).
; The shaft (cols 42-43) opens east at rows 28-29 onto the block top (cols 44-46, row 30), so a single jump climbs out
; of the pit's east bank (TECH-08 kit check; bugs/the-woods-deep-pit-shaft-traps-a-kit-without-the-double-jump).
; The root wall on the west bank (col 32, rows 30-32, in a notch of the slab) opens with Enraizar, so Redoma alone never
; reaches the hole. User, 2026-10-14: "Root wall that opens with Enraizar (Recommended)": "A tangle of roots before the
; hole that only opens once Ivo knows Enraizar, so he can't drop in without the song that brings him back."

[room]
origin = 0, 0
tileset = spring_woods

